subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Send desktop notification for upcoming bills

USAGE:
  subtrack notify <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                       Display this help message
  -v, --version                    Display this version
  --days <days>                    Number of days (default: config notifyDays or 7)
  -c, --channel <channel>          Notification channel: os, slack, webhook (default: config notifyChannels or os)
  --dry-run                        Show upcoming bills without sending notification
  -j, --json                       Output as JSON

